<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS 1 ROSENBORG 0 - LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS 1 ROSENBORG 0 - LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus of Italy led Rosenborg of Norway 1-0 in a European Cup quarter-final second leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Zinedine Zidane 29</p>
<p>Aggregate score: Juventus lead 2-1</p>
